{
  "id": "01_4365",
  "type": "item",
  "name": {
    "ja": "HG 1/144 ガンダムベース限定 シャア専用ザクII(21stCENTURY REAL TYPE Ver.)",
    "en": "HG 1/144 Gundam Base Limited Char's Zaku II (21stCENTURY REAL TYPE Ver.)"
  },
  "price": {
    "amount": 2640,
    "currency": "JPY",
    "taxIncluded": true,
    "taxRate": 10
  },
  "releaseDate": {
    "ja": "2022年11月19日 (土)",
    "year": 2022,
    "month": 11,
    "day": 19
  },
  "targetAge": 8,
  "scale": "1/144",
  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "全世界のガンプラファンにむけた、公式ガンプラ総合施設「ガンダムベース」の限定ガンプラ。",
      "en": "A limited edition Gunpla at the official Gunpla facility \"Gundam Base\" for Gunpla fans around the world."
    },
    {
      "ja": "シャア専用ザクIIが、川口名人完全監修のオリジナルカラーになって登場！",
      "en": "Char's Zaku II is now available in an original color completely supervised by Master Kawaguchi!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• リアルタイプカラーを彷彿とさせるオリジナルイラスト風パッケージ。",
      "en": "• Original illustration style package reminiscent of real type color."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 限定品オリジナルの水転写デカールが付属。",
      "en": "• Includes a limited edition original water slide decal."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• モノアイは頭部裏側の操作リブを動かすことで可動。",
      "en": "• The mono-eye can be moved by moving the operating rib on the back of the head."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 腰部の可動域をさらに広げる軟質素材パーツを同梱。プラパーツと軟質素材パーツとの選択式となっている。",
      "en": "• Includes soft material parts that further expand the range of motion of the lower back. You can choose between plastic parts and soft material parts."
    }
  ],
